<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Hoppinzuil> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Information column of a Hoppin point."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/infrastructuurelementen/#Infozuil>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Intended to indicate that a Transport Hub is a Hoppin Point and/or to inform about the transport options that are offered.\nMore information can be found in the implementation model: https://wegenenverkeer.data.vlaanderen.be/doc/implementatiemodel/hoppinpunten/."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#ResourceRapport> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The report of the number of Resources with similar characteristics of availability, type, service, location, etc that are available at a given time."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Example: The number of shared bicycles available at a train station at a specific location."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#AanvullendeDienst> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Service that complements or supports other Services."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example, Newsagent, Postal Service or Restaurant in a Station. The Services that are supplemented or supported by this are, for example, Mobility Services."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Vervoerregio> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Clusters of municipalities in which mobility is coordinated."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Vervoersknooppunt> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Place where passengers and/or cargo is exchanged between vehicles and/or modes of transport."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Examples of passenger transport are train stations, metro stations, bus stations, airports, ferry terminals, car parks... For cargo transport, it typically involves airports, seaports, transshipment terminals. Transport hubs are typically intermodal, for example travellers combine the (shared) bicycle with the train for their journey, but intramodal transfers (for example from one bus line to another) are also important. In concrete terms, a Transport Hub includes infrastructure (stations, car parks, charging infrastructure, etc.), (mobility) services (public transport lines, shared bicycles, shops, etc.) and nodes in transport networks (public transport stops, shared car stations, etc.)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#GeregistreerdVervoersknooppunt> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transport hub recognised as such."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Vervoersknooppunt>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "This recognition means that a Transport Hub is formally referred to as a Transport Hub. Typically, this is done by the government to give the node an official character (recognizable for the user, meets imposed quality requirements, etc.)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Lader> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An object that provides electrical energy for charging electrical equipment."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/openbaardomein/infrastructuur#Infrastructuurelement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Hoppinpunt> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transport hub of the Hoppin mobility brand."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#GeregistreerdVervoersknooppunt>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Hoppin is the name under which the Flemish government designates Transport hubs for passenger transport that meet established (quality) requirements. Important matters are recognisability (application of the Hoppin house style), accessibility (for all users regardless of their disability, age, etc.), minimal equipment (e.g. bicycle sheds, information carriers, etc.), alignment with mobility plans, etc."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Informatiedrager> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Panel or sign or similar infrastructure on which information is displayed."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/openbaardomein/infrastructuur#Infrastructuurelement>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Intended as a means of communication, usually used in public spaces to inform passers-by. Both static carriers such as information boards with a city map and dynamic systems with, for example, the departure times of public transport are possible."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Datauitwisselingsinfrastructuur> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical facilities aimed at exchanging data."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/openbaardomein/infrastructuur#Infrastructuurelement>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example, servers, cables, modems."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#VirtueleKnoop> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transport node that is dynamically created."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/transportnetwerk#Transportknoop>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "The place where a Journey is started usually does not coincide with an existing Transport Node, for example it is the Traveller's home located between two intersections. In order to still enter the network to start his Journey, the Traveler creates a Virtual Node on the link between these intersections. Virtual Nodes are important to make a correct estimate of the travel time, for example in route planning, because the distance between the Virtual Node and the next real Transport Node must be added. Also important, for example, in the case of free-floating shared transport where the position of, for example, the shared scooter does not necessarily coincide with that of an existing Transport Node."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#ResourceReport.nummer> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#ResourceRapport>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number of Resources."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/vervoersknooppunten#Vervoersknooppunt.classificatie> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
